id: pm-ye46ns
title: "Ordering-evidence tranche: recover sequence edges for terminal work from explicit prerequisite statements already written in item text"
description: "Shippable enabling tranche under pm-gxs55a. The ordering half of the graph is degenerate: of 9456 edges only 664 carry sequence, layer_count is 7, and 1771 of 2004 sequenced nodes have no predecessor. pm-lnrk closed the connectivity deficit and explicitly refused to manufacture ordering edges from release cohorts or parent lineage, which was correct: chronology is not causality and a cohort is not a prerequisite. There is however a source of ordering evidence that is neither inferred nor fabricated, because a human or an agent wrote the assertion down in the item itself. Descriptions, comments, notes and close reasons across the corpus contain explicit prerequisite statements naming an identifier: forms such as blocked by, sequence after, lands first and blocks, gated on, prerequisite, waits on, must land before, and depends on. Each such sentence is a recorded claim about order made by the person who knew, and promoting it to a typed edge records what the corpus already says instead of guessing. The tranche extracts those statements, resolves the direction from the sentence rather than from the position of the identifier, drops every candidate whose direction is ambiguous or reversed, and writes the surviving edges as blocked_by. It is changelog-safe under the same rules pm-3j6it6 established, and it is bounded and resumable so the same extractor can run on a million-item corpus."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
tags[5]: depth,graph,history,relationships,traceability
created_at: "2026-07-27T12:47:29.095Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-31T14:15:56.239Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Candidate ordering edges are extracted only from durable text that names an identifier and states a precedence relation in the sentence itself; Direction is taken from the sentence, and any candidate whose direction is ambiguous or whose sentence names the derived item rather than the prerequisite is dropped rather than resolved by guessing; Every dropped candidate is counted and the drop reasons are reported, so the refusal rate is visible evidence rather than silent filtering; Applied edges are typed blocked_by, create no new cycles, and leave graph audit findings and validate warning classes no worse than before the tranche; The resulting change in ordering depth is measured and reported: predecessor coverage, layer count, and longest ordering path before and after; The extraction runs bounded and resumable so it is executable against a corpus far larger than this workspace"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Turn precedence statements the corpus already contains into traversable ordering edges
value: The project timeline is the part of the graph traversal cannot currently recover; the evidence for much of it is already written down
why_now: "Connectivity is saturated at one component and zero orphans, which makes ordering depth the next and now the only structural deficit"
parent: pm-gxs55a
risk: medium
confidence: high
